
/*Simplified Equation for math dumb-dumbs like me for calculating Width Height based on Original Sprite vs Target Size in game

Simplified Equation
For any given original size (in units 64 = 1 unit) ["𝑊orig","𝐻orig"] and target width "𝑊target":

𝐻target = "𝐻orig" * ("𝑊target" / "𝑊orig")
​
Explanation
Original Width (𝑊orig): The width of the sprite in its original form.
Original Height (𝐻orig): The height of the sprite in its original form.
Target Width (𝑊target: The width you WANT the sprite to be.
Target Height (𝐻target): The height the sprite SHOULD be, calculated to maintain the aspect ratio.

Example: I have a sprite that is originally [7, 17.5] (7*64px, 17.5*64px = Width x Height resolution).  I want it to be width of 3 units wide.
𝑊o = Original Width (𝑊orig): 1.78
𝐻o = Original Height (𝐻orig): 4.42
𝑊t = Target Width (𝑊target: 2
T = Target Height (𝐻target): "T" (Target)

𝐻t = 𝐻o * (𝑊t / 𝑊o)
T = 4.42 * ( 2.5 / 1.78) = 4.96 New Size = [2.5, 6.2]

*/
//NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle0
        NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle0
        {
            Type = ModeToggle
            Mode = NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle
            OnMode = 0
        }
        
//NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle1
        NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle1
        {
            Type = ModeToggle
            Mode = NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle
            OnMode = 1
        }
        NozzleRoofCoverComponents1
        {
            Type = ToggledComponents
            Toggle = NozzleRoofCoverOptionToggle1
            //Invert = true
            Components
            {
                NozzleRoofCoverGraphics1
                {
                    Type = Graphics
                    Location = [1, 2]
                    Roof
                    {
                        Layer = "SW.roof_engines"
                        Offset = [0, 3]
                        DamageLevels
                        [
                            {
                                File = "../Ion_Common/Nozzle_Covers/MED/nozzle_cover_roof_1.png"
                                NormalsFile =  "../Ion_Common/Nozzle_Covers/MED/nozzle_cover_roof_1_normals.png"
                                Size = [4, 16]
                                //UVRotation = 2
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                }
            }
        }

